WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.860
Let's put Claude on your Mac.

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:05.610
Go to claude.com/download and click Mac.

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:09.250
Open the file and drag Claude into your Applications folder.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:10.400
Open Claude.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.700
If your Mac asks, click Open.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:15.870
Sign up or sign in; the code comes by email.

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:18.260
Click Projects, then New project,

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:20.010
and call it Inbox.

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:23.340
Paste your email helper into 'Set project instructions',

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:24.830
then start a chat.

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:26.389
Your trainer takes it from there.

